<title>GREECE: PORTALAKIS, KATSOULIS BROKERAGES BARRED FROM TRADE WEDS.</title>
<headline>PORTALAKIS, KATSOULIS BROKERAGES BARRED FROM TRADE WEDS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Athens stock exchange member firms Portalakis and Katsoulis Securities were barred from trading on Wednesday for failing to comply with settlement regulations with the clearing house.</p>
<p>The trading terminals of Portalakis Brokerage SA at the floor of the exchange were shut down for one-hour while Katsoulis Securities was barred from trade late in the session, sources at the bourse supervisor's office told Reuters. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
